  "slots": [],
  "a11y": "- **Accessible name**: Label the dialog with `Sheet.Heading`, `aria-label`, or `aria-labelledby`.\n- **Focus management**: Opening moves focus into the sheet and contains it within the active modal. Closing restores focus to the trigger; closing a nested sheet restores focus within its parent.\n- **Keyboard**: Use `Tab` and `Shift+Tab` to move between controls. `Escape` closes the sheet when dismissal is enabled.\n- **Close controls**: `Sheet.Close` and `Sheet.CloseTrigger` support keyboard activation, including when `isDismissable={false}`.\n- **Scroll locking**: Page scrolling is locked while the modal is open. `Sheet.Body` scrolls after full expansion. Retained closed content does not keep the page locked.\n- **Drag handle**: The handle is hidden from assistive technology and does not support keyboard dragging. Provide accessible close controls instead of relying solely on swipe gestures."
